# Patch 0928 (wish of DevJunior, 16.11.2026: "the finishers on the ground" of the remake). Not a bug of the prototype:
# a port feature of the mods (runtime/finisher.cpp).
# em10.cpp DownWakeWait (R1 0x1E, a Ganado lying on the floor): every frame re4_ground_prompt may show the "execute"
# prompt; its action hands the Ganado the finishers' Dm_NeckBreak (patch 0921) with a finisher of a body face down or
# face up from a mod pack's melee/finish.dat (a strong Ganado: Leon's blow alone, he lives on).
# em10.cpp Dm_NeckBreak: with a finisher on the floor the Ganado does not follow Leon's steps (its catch timer 0:
# EmCatchMotionMove dragged the body along, into fences; device video 16.11.2026). Declared in re4_whole_prelude.h.
